    "text": "Delphi's visual interface relies on the core principle: *\"The terminal's theme is the palette\"* ([`specs/005e`](005e-console-ux-review-and-redesign.md) §4.1). However, the initial semantic vocabulary ([`specs/053`](053-console-visual-language.md)) and avatar role chassis colors ([`crates/delphi/src/avatar.rs`](../crates/delphi/src/avatar.rs)) were chosen exclusively against dark-background consoles."
